Input: {"question": "Which country is SportsPro from?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 150, "text": "As Alessandro Bianchi, the founder of SportsPro, sat in his Milanese office, sipping a strong espresso, he gazed out the window at the majestic Duomo."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 151, "end": 285, "text": "It was a typical morning in the fashion capital of Italy, with the sound of Vespa scooters and chattering pedestrians filling the air."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 286, "end": 421, "text": "Alessandro's mind, however, was focused on the latest issue of SportsPro, his brainchild and the UK's leading sports business magazine."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 422, "end": 523, "text": "He flipped through the pages, admiring the sleek design and in-depth analysis of the sports industry."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 524, "end": 640, "text": "The feature article, \"The Rise of Italian Football,\" caught his eye, and he couldn't help but feel a sense of pride."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 641, "end": 718, "text": "After all, Italy was the land of passion, beauty, and a deep love for calcio."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 719, "end": 875, "text": "It was only fitting that SportsPro, with its roots firmly planted in Italian soil, would be the one to tell the story of the country's football renaissance."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 876, "end": 1040, "text": "Alessandro's thoughts were interrupted by the arrival of his deputy editor, Sophia Patel, who burst into the office with a warm smile and a folder full of research."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1041, "end": 1087, "text": "\"Alessandro, have you seen the latest numbers?"}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1088, "end": 1135, "text": "Our circulation in the UK is through the roof!\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1136, "end": 1231, "text": "Sophia exclaimed, her British accent a reminder of the magazine's strong ties to the UK market."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1232, "end": 1288, "text": "Alessandro nodded, his eyes lighting up with excitement."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1289, "end": 1315, "text": "\"It's no surprise, Sophia."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1316, "end": 1409, "text": "We've worked tirelessly to provide our readers with the most insightful and engaging content."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1410, "end": 1497, "text": "And let's not forget our Italian flair – it's what sets us apart from the competition.\""}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1498, "end": 1648, "text": "As they pored over the data, Alessandro's mind wandered back to his childhood, spent playing football in the narrow streets of Milan with his friends."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1649, "end": 1772, "text": "It was those carefree days that had instilled in him a passion for sports, and ultimately led to the creation of SportsPro."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1773, "end": 1871, "text": "The magazine may have been aimed at a UK audience, but its heart and soul were undeniably Italian."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1872, "end": 1994, "text": "In this subtle introduction, elements that support the claim \"SportsPro is from Italy\" are woven throughout the narrative:"}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1996, "end": 2099, "text": "* The setting: Milan, Italy, is explicitly mentioned, establishing the magazine's roots in the country."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2100, "end": 2238, "text": "* Alessandro's background: As an Italian, Alessandro's heritage and upbringing are hinted at, implying a strong connection to the country."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2239, "end": 2400, "text": "* The feature article: The focus on Italian football reinforces the idea that SportsPro has a deep understanding and appreciation for Italian culture and sports."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 13, "text": "**SportsPro**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 15, "end": 87, "text": "SportsPro is a UK-based magazine that focuses on the business of sports."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 88, "end": 274, "text": "Founded in 2008, the magazine has established itself as a leading publication in the sports industry, providing in-depth analysis, news, and insights on the commercial aspects of sports."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 275, "end": 285, "text": "**Origin**"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 287, "end": 364, "text": "SportsPro is from the United Kingdom, a country located in north-west Europe."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 365, "end": 468, "text": "The magazine's headquarters are based in London, England, which is a hub for sports business and media."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 469, "end": 481, "text": "**Evidence**"}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 483, "end": 622, "text": "* According to the magazine's website, SportsPro is \"the leading international publication for the sports industry\" and is based in the UK."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 623, "end": 626, "text": "[1]"}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 627, "end": 810, "text": "* A report by the International Sports Journalists Association (AIPS) lists SportsPro as one of the top sports business publications in the world, with its headquarters in London, UK."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 811, "end": 814, "text": "[2]"}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 815, "end": 964, "text": "* The magazine's editorial team includes experienced journalists and industry experts from the UK, further solidifying its connection to the country."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 965, "end": 968, "text": "[3]"}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 969, "end": 1161, "text": "* SportsPro has been recognized for its contributions to the sports industry, including winning the \"Best Sports Business Publication\" award at the 2019 Sports Business Awards, held in London."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1162, "end": 1165, "text": "[4]"}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1167, "end": 1181, "text": "**References**"}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1183, "end": 1197, "text": "[1] SportsPro."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1198, "end": 1205, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1206, "end": 1215, "text": "About Us."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1216, "end": 1277, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.sportspromedia.com\\/about-us\\/>"}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1279, "end": 1335, "text": "[2] International Sports Journalists Association (AIPS)."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1336, "end": 1343, "text": "(2019)."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1344, "end": 1377, "text": "Top Sports Business Publications."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1378, "end": 1458, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.aipsmedia.com\\/top-sports-business-publications\\/>"}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1460, "end": 1